            <h2 class="sec-title text-anime-style-3 text-white">
              THE STORY BEHIND THE BEAUTY
            </h2>

            <p
              class="sec-text4 mb-0 wow fadeInUp"
              data-wow-delay=".3s"
            >
              I am Lasitha, founder of Zaya Beauty Lounge, a makeup artist
              and educator with over 6 years of experience. What began as a
              childhood love for makeup has grown into a passion for creating
              beauty, confidence and meaningful experiences for every client.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="about-wrapp-content">

            <!-- STORY -->
            <div>

              <h4
                class="h6 text-theme wow fadeInUp"
                data-wow-delay=".4s"
              >
                FROM PASSION TO PURPOSE
              </h4>

              <p
                class="sec-text mb-20 pe-xl-4 wow fadeInUp"
                data-wow-delay=".5s"
              >
                I come from a small village in Alappuzha. After completing my
                BCA and MCA from STAS, Pathanamthitta, I chose to follow the
                passion I had carried since childhood. With the support of my
                parents, I stepped into the world of professional beauty and
                makeup.
              </p>

              <p
                class="sec-text mb-20 pe-xl-4 wow fadeInUp"
                data-wow-delay=".6s"
              >
                My first guru was the National Award-winning makeup artist
                Shri Pattanam Rasheed Sir, who gave me the foundation of
                professional makeup. Since then, I have continued to learn
                through national and international training, growing as a
                makeup artist and educator.
              </p>

              <p
                class="sec-text mb-20 pe-xl-4 wow fadeInUp"
                data-wow-delay=".7s"
              >
                I had opportunities to work with the cinema industry, but my
                dream was to create a beauty space of my own. That dream became
                <strong>Zaya</strong> — a place where I could offer world-class
                beauty services with quality, care and affordability.
              </p>

              <!-- EXPERIENCE BOX -->
     

            

            </div>

            <!-- SECOND IMAGE -->
            <div class="img-box3 about-story-image">
              <div class="img2 reveal">
                <img
                  src="assets/img/zaya/abt-1.jpg"
                  alt="Lasitha - Zaya Beauty Lounge"
                />
              </div>
            </div>

          </div>

        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- IMAGE AREA -->
      <div class="col-xl-4 mb-30 mb-xl-0 abt-img">
